{"publicId":"6270fa0e-c955-4395-b524-373414a63226","title":"MNHFF出售包装业务多数股权并计划2027年Q1派发特别股息","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-16T23:24:59.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-16T23:24:59.000Z","digest":"\n\n\nMayr-Melnhof Karton AG (MNHFF) 已宣布将包装业务多数股权出售给KPS Capital Partners，并获得董事会批准向股东派发特别股息（2027年Q1）。CEO Peter Oswald在2026-11-10分析师会议上称交易将优化公司资源配置，但未披露具体出售比例及股息金额。早先报道（2026-11-10）仅提及股权出售，未包含特别股息计划，当前方案需通过股东投票确认。2026-11-17最新报道显示公司通过发布幻灯片补充了特别股息分配细节，但具体金额、股权出售比例及投票时间仍待披露。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-16T23:42:35.732Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Mayr-Melnhof Karton AG 讨论包装业务多数出售及特别股息分配计划","latestReport":{"id":"r5dewv1zkou2lelpeizsrksef"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fNgzyhgYkrPk","title":"Mayr-Melnhof Karton AG 发布包装业务多数出售及计划特别分配的演示文稿","firstReportAt":"2026-11-16T23:24:59.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"r5dewv1zkou2lelpeizsrksef","title":"Mayr-Melnhof Karton AG 讨论包装业务多数出售及特别股息分配计划","summary":"Mayr-Melnhof Karton AG 发布幻灯片讨论了包装业务的多数出售及计划中的特别股息分配。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T23:24:59.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"r5dewv1zkou2lelpeizsrksef","title":"Mayr-Melnhof Karton AG 讨论包装业务多数出售及特别股息分配计划","summary":"Mayr-Melnhof Karton AG 发布幻灯片讨论了包装业务的多数出售及计划中的特别股息分配。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T23:24:59.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-10T19:00:00.000Z","heat":8.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T21:00:00.000Z","heat":8.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T23:00:00.000Z","heat":7.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T00:00:00.000Z","heat":7.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z","heat":7.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T02:00:00.000Z","heat":7.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T03:00:00.000Z","heat":7,"participants":1},{"hour":"202